                "number": 16,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does Sam say about the festival tickets?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "They allow you to get into all the festival events."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "They are more expensive to buy on the day."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "They have nearly all been sold."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 17,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;On the last night of the festival, visitors will be able to",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "take part in a dance."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "go to a theatre performance."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "watch some fireworks."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 18,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What will be provided for international visitors?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "discounts on accommodation"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "tours of the local area"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "a guide written in different languages"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 19,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What information is given about car park A?",
